    ]
)
;;#65bL Phase 7 fix: the STOA-repricing loop in SWP|CC_SmartSwap{With,No}Slippage
;;(04_TS01-C3.pact) now also builds ONE [GraphNode] graph (SWPT::UC_MakeGraphFromRaw)
;;alongside the shared raw-graph fetch (Phase 4), and calls SWPI::URC_PoolValueFromGraph
;;for every distinct pool touched, instead of each pool's own URC_PoolValueFromRaw call
;;independently re-deriving the identical [GraphNode] graph from the shared raw-graph.
;;Proves the shared-graph-build version produces EXACTLY the same result as the
;;original, unchanged URC_PoolValue for a real pool — correctness preserved, not just
;;"still runs."
;;==== SWP|TX 032z6e - #65bL Phase 7 Proof · 02 · direct comparison ====
(print "--- [SWP|TX 032z6e - #65bL Phase 7 Proof · 02 · direct comparison] ---")
