;;issuance (SWP|C_IssueStandard/C_IssueStable) does NOT auto-create the underlying
;;DPTF tokens; they must already exist (missed this the first time, caught via a
;;real "No value found in table ... DPTF|PropertiesTable for key: TSTE-..." error
;;at full-regression time, not assumed).
